        "height": 664,
        "content": "## 1. Fetch & clean\nRun on a schedule, fetch the page and strip it to clean text. Fetch failures go to Slack."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "26179022-e2ef-4f0a-88e9-8a5e69db21e7",
      "name": "S2",
